    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creative/testing power supply. It replenishes stored FE; it is not intended as a survival progression reward."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Set up and operate"
    },
    {
      "type": "steps",
      "rows": [
        [
          "Place it in a test world."
        ],
        [
          "Enable a permitted output face."
        ],
        [
          "Use it to isolate receiver-side problems, then retest with a finite survival source."
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "When it does not run"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Do not treat a test with an unlimited source as proof that your normal generator can meet the required throughput."
    },
